\s1 The Descendants of David
\r (2 Samuel 3:1–5)
\p \v 1 \w These|strong="H00428"\w* \w were|strong="H01961"\w* \w the sons|strong="H01121"\w* \w of David|strong="H01732"\w* \w who|strong="H00834"\w* \w were born|strong="H03205"\w* to him \w in Hebron|strong="H02275"\w*:
\b 
