\li1 \w Beerah|strong="H01931"\w* \w was a leader|strong="H05387"\w* \w of the Reubenites|strong="H07206"\w*. \v 7 \w His relatives|strong="H00251"\w* \w by their clans|strong="H04940"\w* \w are recorded|strong="H03187"\w* \w in their genealogy|strong="H08435"\w*:
