\s1 The Descendants of Aaron
\p \v 48 \w Their fellow|strong="H00251"\w* \w Levites|strong="H03881"\w* \w were assigned|strong="H05414"\w* \w to every kind|strong="H03605"\w* \w of service|strong="H05656"\w* \w of the tabernacle|strong="H04908"\w*, \w the house|strong="H01004"\w* \w of God|strong="H00430"\w*. \v 49 \w But Aaron|strong="H00175"\w* \w and his sons|strong="H01121"\w* \w did all|strong="H03605"\w* \w the work|strong="H04399"\w* \w of the Most Holy Place|strong="H06944"\w* \w . . .|strong="H06944"\w*.\f + \fr 6:49 \ft Or \fqa the Holy of Holies\f* \w They presented the offerings|strong="H06999"\w* \w on|strong="H05921"\w* \w the altar|strong="H04196"\w* \w of burnt offering|strong="H05930"\w* \w and on|strong="H05921"\w* \w the altar|strong="H04196"\w* \w of incense|strong="H07004"\w* \w to make atonement|strong="H03722"\w* \w for|strong="H05921"\w* \w Israel|strong="H03478"\w*, \w according to all|strong="H03605"\w* \w that|strong="H00834"\w* \w Moses|strong="H04872"\w* \w the servant|strong="H05650"\w* \w of God|strong="H00430"\w* \w had commanded|strong="H06680"\w*.
