\p \v 66 \w And some of the clans|strong="H04940"\w* \w of the Kohathites|strong="H01121"\w* \w . . .|strong="H06955"\w* \w . . .|strong="H01961"\w* \w were given cities|strong="H05892"\w* \w from the tribe|strong="H04294"\w* \w of Ephraim|strong="H00669"\w* \w for their territory|strong="H01366"\w*:
