\s1 Saul’s Overthrow and Death
\r (1 Samuel 31:1–6; 2 Samuel 1:1–16)
\p \v 1 \w Now the Philistines|strong="H06430"\w* \w fought|strong="H03898"\w* \w against Israel|strong="H03478"\w*, \w and the men|strong="H00376"\w* \w of Israel|strong="H03478"\w* \w fled|strong="H05127"\w* \w before|strong="H06440"\w* \w them|strong="H06430"\w*, \w and [many] fell|strong="H05307"\w* \w slain|strong="H02491"\w* \w on Mount|strong="H02022"\w* \w Gilboa|strong="H01533"\w*.
