ored|strong="H03513"\w* \w among|strong="H04480"\w* \w the Thirty|strong="H07970"\w*, \w . . .|strong="H02005"\w* \w but he|strong="H01931"\w* \w did not|strong="H03808"\w* \w become|strong="H00935"\w* \w one of|strong="H00413"\w* \w the Three|strong="H07969"\w*. \w And David|strong="H01732"\w* \w appointed him|strong="H07760"\w* \w over|strong="H05921"\w* \w his guard|strong="H04928"\w*.
