m, Jeiel, and Azaziah \ft or \fqa Obed-edom, Jeiel, and Ozias\f*
\p \v 19 \w The musicians|strong="H07891"\w* \w Heman|strong="H01968"\w*, \w Asaph|strong="H00623"\w*, \w and Ethan|strong="H00387"\w* \w were to sound|strong="H08085"\w* \w the bronze|strong="H05178"\w* \w cymbals|strong="H04700"\w*. \v 20 \w Zechariah|strong="H02148"\w*, \w Aziel|strong="H05815"\w*,\f + \fr 15:20 \fqa Aziel \ft is a variant of \fqa Jaaziel\ft ; see verse 18.\f* \w Shemiramoth|strong="H08070"\w*, \w Jehiel|strong="H03171"\w*, \w Unni|strong="H06042"\w*, \w Eliab|strong="H00446"\w*, \w Maaseiah|strong="H04641"\w*, \w and Benaiah|strong="H01141"\w* \w were to play the harps|strong="H05035"\w* \w according to|strong="H05921"\w* \w Alamoth|strong="H05961"\w*.\f + \fr 15:20 \fqa Alamoth\ft is probably a musical or liturgical term; here and in Psalm 46:1.\f* \v 21 \w And Mattithiah|strong="H04993"\w*, \w Eliphelehu|strong="H00466"\w*, \w Mikneiah|strong="H04737"\w*, \w vvv|strong="H05654"\w* \w Obed-edom|strong="H05654"\w*, \w Jeiel|strong="H03273"\w*, \w and Azaziah|strong="H05812"\w* \w were to lead the music|strong="H05329"\w* \w with lyres|strong="H03658"\w* \w according to|strong="H05921"\w* \w Sheminith|strong="H08067"\w*.\f + \fr 15:21 \fqa Sheminith\ft is probably a musical term; here and in Psalm 6:1 and Psalm 12:1.\f* \v 22 \w Chenaniah|strong="H03663"\w* \w the head|strong="H08269"\w* \w Levite|strong="H03881"\w* \w -|strong="H04853"\w* \w was the director|strong="H03256"\w* \w of the music|strong="H04853"\w* \w because|strong="H03588"\w* \w he [was]|strong="H01931"\w* \w highly skilled|strong="H00995"\w*.
\p \v 23 \w Berechiah|strong="H01296"\w* \w and Elkanah|strong="H00511"\w* \w were to be guardians|strong="H07778"\w*\f + \fr 15:23 \ft Literally \fqa gatekeepers\ft ; also in verse 24\f* \w of the ark|strong="H00727"\w*. \v 24 \w Shebaniah|strong="H07645"\w*, \w Joshaphat|strong="H03146"\w*, \w Nethanel|strong="H05417"\w*, \w Amasai|strong="H06022"\w*, \w Zechariah|strong="H02148"\w*, \w Benaiah|strong="H01141"\w*, \w and Eliezer|strong="H00461"\w* — \w the priests|strong="H03548"\w* — \w were to blow|strong="H02690"\w* \w the trumpets|strong="H02689"\w* \w before|strong="H06440"\w* \w the ark|strong="H00727"\w* \w of God|strong="H00430"\w*. \w vvv|strong="H05654"\w* \w Obed-edom|strong="H05654"\w* \w and Jehiah|strong="H03174"\w* \w were also to be guardians|strong="H07778"\w* \w of the ark|strong="H00727"\w*.
