\p \v 7 \w On that|strong="H01931"\w* \w . . .|strong="H00227"\w* \w day|strong="H03117"\w* \w David|strong="H01732"\w* \w first|strong="H07218"\w* \w committed|strong="H05414"\w* \w to|strong="H03027"\w* \w Asaph|strong="H00623"\w* \w and his associates|strong="H00251"\w* \w [this song] of thanksgiving|strong="H03034"\w* \w to the LORD|strong="H03068"\w*:
