\li1 \v 7 \w The Gershonites|strong="H01649"\w*: \w Ladan|strong="H03936"\w*\f + \fr 23:7 \fqa Ladan \ft is a variant of \fqa Libni\ft ; also in verses 8 and 9; see 1 Chronicles 6:17.\f* \w and Shimei|strong="H08096"\w*.
\li1 \v 8 \w The sons|strong="H01121"\w* \w of Ladan|strong="H03936"\w*: \w Jehiel|strong="H03171"\w*\f + \fr 23:8 \fqa Jehiel \ft is a variant of \fqa Jehieli\ft ; see 1 Chronicles 26:21.\f* \w the first|strong="H07218"\w*, \w Zetham|strong="H02241"\w*, \w and Joel|strong="H03100"\w*— \w three [in all]|strong="H07969"\w*.
