\li1 \w the weight|strong="H04948"\w* \w of all|strong="H03605"\w* \w the silver|strong="H03701"\w* \w articles|strong="H03627"\w* \w for every kind|strong="H03605"\w* \w . . .|strong="H03627"\w* \w of service|strong="H05656"\w* \w . . .|strong="H05656"\w*;
